	"BoxerUI Page: contract-driven grid page": {
		"scope": "markdown",
		"prefix": "bx-page-grid",
		"body": [
			"<prompt>",
			"  <task>${1:Scaffold a ... page: filterable data grid}${2: with CSV export}.</task>",
			"  <files>",
			"    - Components/Pages/${3:Entities}Page.razor",
			"  </files>",
			"  <route>${4:/entities}</route>",
			"",
			"  <composition>${5:Page heading carrying actions}; ContractGrid as the main region${6:; density choice and why}</composition>",
			"",
			"  <components>",
			"    <required>ContractGrid${7:, Button}</required>",
			"    <suggested>${8:Components or services worth reaching for per region.}</suggested>",
			"  </components>",
			"",
			"  <forbidden>",
			"    - No hand-rolled table markup and no skeleton over the grid — the contract renders the grid; QuickGrid virtualization owns the loading rows",
			"    - No client-side re-sorting of fetched pages — sorting and filtering flow through the contract's query surface",
			"  </forbidden>",
			"",
			"  <data>",
			"    <service>${9:IEntityService.QueryAsync(GridQuery) → PagedResult&lt;EntityDto&gt;}</service>",
			"    <model>${10:Entity}GridContract over ${11:EntityDto} — columns, formats, and CSV from one contract</model>",
			"    <ownership>FilterState&lt;${11:EntityDto}&gt; owned by the page and disposed with it</ownership>",
			"  </data>",
			"",
			"  <behavior>",
			"    - The contract drives columns, formats, and sort keys; filter inputs debounce into FilterState",
			"    - Rows in flight render as QuickGrid placeholder rows — geometry holds, no page-level loading UI",
			"    - ${12:Further behavior, one bullet each.}",
			"  </behavior>",
			"",
			"  <assert>",
			"    - Clicking a sortable header toggles aria-sort and reorders the rows",
			"    - Typing in a column filter narrows the rows after the debounce window",
			"    - ${13:Further assertions, one bullet each.}",
			"  </assert>",
			"",
			"  <guardrails>",
			"    - Read applicable repository instructions, BoxerUI catalog guidance, and target files before editing; preserve unrelated and intervening human changes.",
			"    - Do not add packages or perform external/destructive actions without approval. Verify each assertion with the available test harness; report anything unverified.",
			"    - Never reproduce secret values in responses, logs, reports, durable artefacts, or transmitted data; identify only their type and location, and redact them.",
			"    - Do not transmit personal/customer/production data, proprietary material, or regulated data to external services without approval; when authorized, minimize and redact the data.",
			"  </guardrails>",
			"</prompt>",
			"$0"
		],
		"description": "Grid page routed through GridContracts — names the contract, never table internals (README Example 4)"
	},
	"BoxerUI Page: form page": {
		"scope": "markdown",
		"prefix": "bx-page-form",
		"body": [
			"<prompt>",
			"  <task>${1:Scaffold a ... form page.}</task>",
			"  <files>",
			"    - Components/Pages/${2:Form}Page.razor",
			"  </files>",
			"  <route>${3:/route}</route>",
			"",
			"  <composition>${4:Single-column EditForm inside a Card; Notification feedback on submit}</composition>",
			"",
			"  <components>",
			"    <required>${5:Input, Textarea, SelectMenu, Checkbox, Button}</required>",
			"    <suggested>${6:Notification via INotificationService for success/error}</suggested>",
			"  </components>",
			"",
			"  <forbidden>",
			"    - ${7:Page-level don'ts — e.g. no ValidationSummary, per-field messages only on this page}",
			"  </forbidden>",
			"",
			"  <data>",
			"    <service>${8:IExampleService.SubmitAsync(Request) → Result&lt;SubmitError&gt;}</service>",
			"    <model>${9:Request} { ${10:Fields} } with DataAnnotations</model>",
			"    <ownership>Local form model; EditForm owns the EditContext</ownership>",
			"  </data>",
			"",
			"  <behavior>",
			"    - EditForm + DataAnnotationsValidator; every field bound with @bind-Value",
			"    - ${11:Which fields surface their own validation message vs pair with ValidationMessage}",
			"    - ${12:Submit disabled while pending; Notification on success and on error; form resets on success}",
			"  </behavior>",
			"",
			"  <assert>",
			"    - ${13:Empty submit: required messages render under ..., both carry aria-invalid}",
			"    - ${14:Valid submit: a success notification appears and the fields return to pristine}",
			"    - ${15:Service error: an error notification appears and the entered values are preserved}",
			"  </assert>",
			"",
			"  <guardrails>",
			"    - Read applicable repository instructions, BoxerUI catalog guidance, and target files before editing; preserve unrelated and intervening human changes.",
			"    - Do not add packages or perform external/destructive actions without approval. Verify each assertion with the available test harness; report anything unverified.",
			"    - Never reproduce secret values in responses, logs, reports, durable artefacts, or transmitted data; identify only their type and location, and redact them.",
			"    - Do not transmit personal/customer/production data, proprietary material, or regulated data to external services without approval; when authorized, minimize and redact the data.",
			"  </guardrails>",
			"</prompt>",
			"$0"
		],
		"description": "Form page — page-level choices only; InputBase doctrine is ambient (README Example 2)"
	},
